# WebSocket Communication

The application uses WebSockets for real-time game interactions.

## Frontend WebSocket

- [contexts/WebSocketContext.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/contexts/WebSocketContext.tsx) - WebSocket context provider
- [hooks/use-game-websocket.ts](mdc:goweb/src/hooks/use-game-websocket.ts) - Game WebSocket hook
- [components/test/WebSocketTest.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/components/test/WebSocketTest.tsx) - WebSocket test component
- [app/socket-demo/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/socket-demo/page.tsx) - WebSocket demo page

## Backend WebSocket

- [WebSocketConfig.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/configs/WebSocketConfig.java) - WebSocket configuration
- [GameController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/GameController.java) - Handles game WebSocket messages
- [WebSocketDisconnectHandler.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/WebSocketDisconnectHandler.java) - Handles disconnections

## Message Types

- [ChatMessage.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/model/ChatMessage.java) - Chat message model
- [MoveMessage.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/model/MoveMessage.java) - Game move model
- [JoinRoomMessage.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/model/JoinRoomMessage.java) - Room join message
- [ChatMessage.ts](mdc:goweb/src/types/ChatMessage.ts) - Frontend chat message type
